# A blanket *.png here meant every icon and the social card were silently
# untracked, so the live site 404'd on /icon-180.png, /icon-small-32.png and
# og-image.png while every local preview looked perfect — the files were on
# disk, just never committed. Only fetching the deployed site found it.
#
# So: ignore by intent, not by extension. The site's own images are the site.

# Master artwork. A megabyte of source PNG that nothing links to, and this repo
# is served by Pages, so an unlinked file here is still a public URL.
brand/logo/logo-master.png
brand/logo/logo-square.png

.DS_Store
node_modules/
